                <pb facs="0182" n="74" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg74"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Thompson to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Petropolis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-11-15"><hi rendition="#italic">November 15, 1893</hi></date>.
                        (Received November 16.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Thompson announces that the State of Pernambuco has this day been placed
                    under martial law.</p>
            </div>
